{"id":1166,"level":72,"name":"Наскрізні атаки","group":"Пошук найкращого ходу","format":27,"description":"<p>A skewer is a long pin that is pushed through pieces of food. You probably know it from barbecueing. Chess also has skewers. <em>Skewers</em> are attacks that go right through pieces.</p><p>Skewers and pins are very similar. A skewer is like a pin turned the other way around. In a pin, the piece of greater value is behind a piece of lesser value. In a skewer, the more valuable piece is in front of the lesser piece.</p><p><br></p><p>Often, the skewered piece is the king. The king is checked and must move. The target is the piece behind the king. If that is unprotected, it will be captured.</p><p>If the skewered piece is worth more than its attacker, the piece behind is lost. A rook will flee from a bishop. Then, the bishop will take the piece further on the diagonal.</p><p>To spot a skewer or a pin, you have to be aware of pieces that are lined up along a rank, a file or a diagonal.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong></p><p>Carry out a skewer and win material.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":63,"examples":[{"fen":"3R4/r5B1/7P/2k2p2/5P2/7r/3K4/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ya7]} 1. Bd4+ {[%csl Rc5][%cal Gd4a7]} Kc6 2. Bxa7 1-0","text":"<p>Поставивши чек посередині дошки, білі виграють матеріал. Чорного короля потрібно відсунути вбік, і тоді білі можуть взяти туру. Також важливо, щоб слон був захищений на старті.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"R7/2k2n2/1p6/1P6/8/4K3/8/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yf7]} 1. Ra7+ {[%csl Rc7][%cal Ga7f7]} Kd6 2. Rxf7 1-0","text":"<p>Цього разу ми використовуємо незахищеного коня. Білі дають шах, а потім забирають коня.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":50725,"fen":"6R1/8/7k/6p1/6p1/4K3/7r/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yh2]} 1. Rh8+ Kg6 2. Rxh2 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41049,"fen":"1n4k1/5p1p/6p1/3N4/8/8/Pr3PPP/4K2R b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yh1]} 1... Rb1+ 2. Ke2 Rxh1 0-1",